{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07249","headline":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 寒釭 · 刘长卿","name":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 寒釭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向夕灯稍进，空堂弥寂寞。\n光寒对愁人，时复一花落。\n但恐明见累，何愁暗难托。\n恋君秋夜永，无使兰膏薄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}